Diagnostic A — cross-condition probe transfer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Read: NEUTRAL-trained probe -> FUNC-PFX invented unary mass.
  If high (~80%+) on both models, attractor is robust across notations.
  If high on OLMo only, the attractor is OLMo-specific in functional notation.

