  OLMo 2 7B       CV=0.992  within-NEUTRAL= 99.6%  cross-canon-acc=1.000  cross-FUNC-PFX=  0.0%

Diagnostic B — held-out canonical arity-class %
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Read: mean arity-class % across held-out canonicals at the focus layer.
  Structural: binary held-out ~50%+ to binaries, unary held-out ~25%+ to unaries.
  Surface-overfit: held-out class predicted at chance over four trained classes.

